	(text "Input buffer (U701A, OPA1656) and output stages (U702, OPA1688), the Timekeeper's ANALOG_FRONT on one 5 V rail biased at VCOM.\nIn: 1M to ground at the relay, 100n film, 1M bias to VCOM_A, follower (R703 0R; R704 + C707 to VCOM_A, both DNP, set gain), 5k1 / 220p to the ADC driver.\nOut: unity-gain difference amplifier per channel (10k x4) referenced to VCOM_B, 10u out, 100R series, 1M pull-down."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
